<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Coca-Cola lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Coca-Cola lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schroder and Co said it downgraded Coca-Cola Co to &quot;perform in line&quot; from &quot;outperform significantly.&quot;</p>
<p>-- further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- stock was off 3/4 to 69-1/8.</p>
</text>
